### Third-Party & Model Licenses

#### Desert Ant Voz (`Voz`)
SayItFlow uses Desert Ant's Voz model for on-device speech-to-text recognition via `desert-ant-core`.

- **Copyright**: Copyright © 2026 Desert Ant Labs B.V.
- **License**: Desert Ant Labs Source-Available License, Version 1.0
- **SPDX Identifier**: `LicenseRef-DAL-Source-Available-1.0`
- **Authoritative Terms**: https://license.desertant.com/1.0
- **Attribution Policy**: https://license.desertant.com/attribution

**Summary of Terms**:
- Free for use below 100,000 monthly active devices per platform. Above that threshold, a commercial license from Desert Ant Labs is required (<licensing@desertant.com>).
- Models may be embedded in applications.
- You may NOT use the models, their outputs, or their logs to train competing on-device speech models.
- Attribution to Desert Ant Labs must be maintained.

#### S1-mini by Superwhisper (`S1-mini`)
SayItFlow integrates "S1-mini" by "Superwhisper" for on-device speech-to-text post-processing and text normalization.

- **Copyright**: Copyright © 2026 Superwhisper
- **License**: Apache License, Version 2.0 (with Additional Term)
- **Model URL**: https://huggingface.co/superwhisper/s1-mini
- **Author**: Superwhisper (https://superwhisper.com)

**Additional Term Compliance**:
In accordance with the additional term of the upstream Apache-2.0 license:
Any use, distribution, or integration of this model, whether unmodified or as part of a derivative work or product, continues to identify it by its original name, **"S1-mini"** by **"Superwhisper"**, using that exact capitalization.
